## SQ-BBQF-01 | six BBQ seasonings and grilled defined
@group A
@commands Boot, grep `[seasoning]` in logs/kubejs/startup.log
@pass `defined` lines for the 6 BBQ seasonings and `barbequesdelight:grilled`; no `bad definition`
@fails CD `kubejs_startup/creativeengineering/seasonings.js`, BBQ `compat/PackSeasonings.java`; TODO `food/seasoning #11`
@from batches/r1103/sA_2.qb
shell grep -hE "\[seasoning\]" logs/kubejs/startup.log | head -20
shell echo "defined lines: $(grep -hcE '\[seasoning\].*defined' logs/kubejs/startup.log || true)"
shell grep -qhE "\[seasoning\].*defined.*barbequesdelight:grilled" logs/kubejs/startup.log
shell ! grep -hE "\[seasoning\].*bad definition" logs/kubejs/startup.log
look defined lines for the 6 BBQ seasonings (barbeque_sauce, buffalo_sauce, chili, cumin, honey_mustard, pepper) and barbequesdelight:grilled

